@page "/"

<PageTitle>AgenticUI — AG-UI for .NET</PageTitle>

<div class="home">
    <header class="home__hero">
        <span class="scenario__eyebrow">AG-UI · Blazor · Microsoft Foundry</span>
        <h1>Build agentic experiences<br />with .NET</h1>
        <p class="lead">
            An interactive Dojo for AG-UI scenarios powered by Microsoft Agent Framework,
            the latest Blazor AI components, and Microsoft Foundry.
        </p>
    </header>

    <div class="cards">
        <a class="card" href="agentic-chat">
            <span class="card__index">01</span>
            <h3>Agentic chat</h3>
            <p>Streaming, multi-turn conversation over AG-UI Server-Sent Events.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="backend-tools">
            <span class="card__index card__index--mint">02</span>
            <h3>Backend tools</h3>
            <p>The agent calls a server-side tool; the UI renders a custom card for the result.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="frontend-tools">
            <span class="card__index card__index--yellow">03</span>
            <h3>Frontend tools</h3>
            <p>The model calls a client-side tool that runs in the browser.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="human-in-the-loop">
            <span class="card__index card__index--orange">04</span>
            <h3>Human in the loop</h3>
            <p>A tool requires approval; the run pauses for Approve / Reject.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="shared-state">
            <span class="card__index card__index--mint">05</span>
            <h3>Shared state</h3>
            <p>Agent and UI share a structured object via state snapshots.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="agentic-generative-ui">
            <span class="card__index">06</span>
            <h3>Agentic generative UI</h3>
            <p>Live plan progress driven by state snapshots and JSON-Patch deltas.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="predictive-state-updates">
            <span class="card__index card__index--orange">07</span>
            <h3>Predictive state updates</h3>
            <p>Stream proposed document edits, then explicitly accept or reject them.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="reasoning">
            <span class="card__index card__index--yellow">08</span>
            <h3>Reasoning</h3>
            <p>A reasoning model's reasoning summary, shown separately from its answer.</p>
        </a>
    </div>
</div>
